  title: Bangladesh Liberation War
  text: In 1971, after Pakistan's crackdown in East Pakistan and the flight of about ten million refugees to India, India supported the Mukti Bahini and went to war. Pakistan's forces surrendered at Dhaka on 16 December 1971, and Bangladesh was born.
